--------------------------- MODULE BitmapScanTrace ---------------------------
(* Trace validation: is a whole-range batch an instrumented build ran a behavior of BitmapScan?
   The universe (rows, pages, sectors, the entries each worker examined) is the run's own
   (BitmapScanTraceData, generated by traces/bitmap/bitmap2tla.py); the cfg substitutes it
   for the small enumerated universe of BitmapScan.  A leaf of the trace is everything one
   worker marked: the build logs the marks, not the leaf and overflow pages it walked.
   Every logged event must be the action it names, by that thread, on that row, page or
   sector, with the logged outcome.  Not logged, and taken here only towards the next event:
   a worker taking and ending its leaf, and the lookup of a marked row the snapshot does not
   see on a page read as a whole (the page walk passes it without a call).
   Vacuum threads log every record they remove and every page that is deallocated; the
   generator keeps the rows and the listed pages of the scan.
   Accepted iff TLC reaches i = Len(TraceLog). *)
EXTENDS BitmapScan, BitmapScanTraceData, Integers

CONSTANTS TraceLog, TraceLossy
VARIABLE i
TVars == <<vars, i>>

LeafOfWorker(w) == "L" \o w

\* A row of the trace is its OID <<volume, page, slot>>, a page <<volume, page>>, a sector <<volume, sector>>
\* (64 pages a sector).  A page outside the sector list has no listed sector.
TNoRow == <<-1, -1, -1>>
TNoPage == <<-1, -1>>
TNoSector == <<-1, -2>>
TPageOf(r) == <<r[1], r[2]>>
TSectorOfPage(p) == <<p[1], p[2] \div 64>>
TSectorOf(r) == IF TPageOf(r) \in ListedPages THEN TSectorOfPage(TPageOf(r)) ELSE <<-1, -3>>

TInit == Init /\ lossy = TraceLossy /\ i = 0
Ev == TraceLog[i + 1]

Logged ==
  /\ i < Len(TraceLog)
  /\ i' = i + 1
  /\ \/ /\ Ev.a = "Mark"
        /\ MarkRow(Ev.p, Ev.row)
        /\ \/ Ev.kind = "row" /\ Ev.row \in bm'
           \/ Ev.kind = "page" /\ PageOf(Ev.row) \in pagebm' /\ bm' = bm
           \/ Ev.kind = "drop" /\ SectorOf(Ev.row) \notin ListedSectors /\ dropped'
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "IdxFinish"
        /\ IdxFinish(Ev.p)
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "TakeSector"
        /\ TakeSectorS(Ev.p, Ev.sect)
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "FixPage"
        /\ FixPageP(Ev.p, Ev.page)
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "PageGone"
        /\ SkipFreedPageP(Ev.p, Ev.page)
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "Vacuum"
        /\ VacuumRow(Ev.row)
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "FreePage"
        /\ FreePageP(Ev.page)
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "Lookup"
        /\ LookupRow(Ev.p, Ev.row)
        /\ \/ Ev.res \in {"invisible", "gone"} /\ Ev.row \notin Vis
           \/ Ev.res = "recheck" /\ Ev.row \in Vis /\ PageOf(Ev.row) \in pagebm /\ Ev.row \notin IdxRows
           \/ Ev.res = "filtered" /\ Ev.row \in Vis /\ out' = out
                /\ ~(PageOf(Ev.row) \in pagebm /\ Ev.row \notin IdxRows)
           \/ Ev.res = "out" /\ out'[Ev.row] = out[Ev.row] + 1
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "ReleasePage"
        /\ held[Ev.p] = Ev.page
        /\ ReleasePage(Ev.p)
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "EndSector"
        /\ EndSector(Ev.p)
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "Abort"
        /\ Abort

\* Steps the build does not log, only for the thread of the next event (a leaf may also be
\* taken for any worker when the next event ends an index phase: every leaf is handed out by then).
Hidden ==
  /\ i < Len(TraceLog)
  /\ UNCHANGED i
  /\ \/ /\ Ev.a = "Mark"
        /\ leafOf[Ev.p] = NoLeaf
        /\ TakeLeafL(Ev.p, LeafOfWorker(Ev.p))
     \/ /\ Ev.a = "IdxFinish"
        /\ \/ EndLeaf(Ev.p)
           \/ \E w \in IdxWorkers : TakeLeafL(w, LeafOfWorker(w))
     \/ /\ Ev.a \in {"ReleasePage", "EndSector", "FixPage", "Lookup"}
        /\ \E r \in Rows :
             /\ r \notin Vis /\ r \in IdxRows /\ PageOf(r) \in pagebm
             /\ LookupRow(Ev.p, r)

TSpec == TInit /\ [][Logged \/ Hidden]_TVars

TraceNotDone == i < Len(TraceLog)
=============================================================================
